            <div class="stakes-content">
                <h2>Somewhere Between Childhood and Adulthood, We Forgot How to Play</h2>
                <p>The world tells us whimsy is frivolous. That creativity should be productive. That magic is just for kids.</p>
                <p>But what if the opposite is true? What if the moments when life feels heaviest are exactly when you need a project that makes you smile? What if choosing wonder over beige is an act of courage?</p>
                <p>You deserve more than mass-produced mediocrity. You deserve patterns with personality, fabrics that tell stories, and a creative community that celebrates your curiosity.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Solution: Three Paths Forward -->
    <section class="solutions">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Your Creative Playground Awaits</h2>
            
            <div class="solution-grid">
                <!-- Patterns Card -->
                <div class="solution-card" id="patterns">
                    <button class="pinterest-btn" onclick="pinIt('patterns')">📌 Pin</button>
