                    <p>Every Stitch tells a story. Each pattern is carefully crafted to bring joy, wonder, and imagination to turn your creations into storytelling adventures. What story will your creations tell?</p>
                    <p><strong>Shop our collections on Spoonflower:</strong> Quality fabrics with personality</p>
                    <a href="#" class="cta-secondary" target="_blank">Visit Our Collections</a>
                </div>

                <!-- Blog Card -->
                <div class="solution-card" id="blog">
                    <button class="pinterest-btn" onclick="pinIt('blog')">📌 Pin</button>
                    <h3>Creative Inspiration</h3>
                    <p>Tutorials, tips, and stories to fuel your creative journey. Learn new techniques, discover project ideas, and join a community that believes imagination isn't optional—it's essential.</p>
                    <p><strong>New posts weekly:</strong> From quick fixes to masterpieces</p>
