            <p>You're working on a project that actually excites you. The pattern makes sense. The fabric makes you smile every time you look at it. Each stitch feels less like a chore and more like play. And when you finish? You've created something beautiful, functional, and unmistakably <em>yours</em>—something that reminds you creativity isn't a luxury. It's who you are.</p>
            <a href="#patterns" class="cta-primary">Start Your Next Project</a>
        </div>
    </section>

